==German==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|[[hōchzīt]], [[hōchgezīt]]}}, from {{m|goh|hōha gezīt||high celebration}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/ˈhɔxt͡saɪt/|lang=de}}

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[wedding]], [[marriage]] celebration
#: {{ux|de|Die '''Hochzeit''' des Figaro|The Marriage of Figaro (opera)}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|de|Elefantenhochzeit}}
* {{l|de|Goldhochzeit}}
* {{l|de|Silberhochzeit}}
* {{l|de|Vogelhochzeit}}

====See also====
* {{l|de|Ehe||marriage}}

